# The build history (docs/ART-PROJECT.md §2.5, §2.8): day zips, diary
# videos, logs/ (unmasked originals), prompts.* and the work files (.work/:
# renders, contact sheets, the gallery) are not in git; the zips and videos
# are on the GitHub release "build-history" of newkit/OCW-ART. Tracked: the
# masked text files index.md, SHA256SUMS and per day journal.md,
# journal.json, tokens.json, incidents.md (the root-cause notes, §2.6), and,
# through Git LFS (.gitattributes), the pictures and videos of the days in
# the managed `lfs-days` block at the end (`diary.py lfs-commit`, within the
# budget; the media of the other days stay local and ignored).
/build-history/**
!/build-history/????-??-??/
!/build-history/index.md
!/build-history/SHA256SUMS
!/build-history/withheld.txt
!/build-history/????-??-??/journal.md
!/build-history/????-??-??/journal.json
!/build-history/????-??-??/tokens.json
!/build-history/????-??-??/incidents.md

# The local settings (OCW checkout; see README.md).
/ocw-art.toml

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/

# >>> lfs-days
# The days whose pictures/videos are in Git LFS (ART-PROJECT §2.8), written by
# `diary.py lfs-commit`: do not edit by hand.
